# BAB 5. Operational APIs

## 5.1 Overview

Bab ini mendefinisikan kontrak REST domain **Operasional**: Procurement, Inventory, Sales, dan Manufacturing. Aksi domain (confirm, reserve, receive, ship) memicu *event* yang menggerakkan alur lintas modul (INT-001/002); reservasi stok bersifat Exactly-Once (ADR-005). Resource memetakan ke DBDD BAB 6 dan mengikuti standar BAB 2.

---

## 5.2 Procurement API — API-016

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/purchase-requisitions`, `/v1/purchase-orders`, `/v1/goods-receipts` |
| Layanan | SVC-012 procurement-service |
| Tabel | `pr.purchase_requisition`, `po.purchase_order`, `gr.goods_receipt` |
| Referensi | 9.7, INT-002 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                                        | Deskripsi                                      |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `POST /v1/purchase-requisitions`                      | Buat PR (memicu workflow approval, INT-004).   |
| `POST /v1/purchase-requisitions/{id}/submit`          | Ajukan PR untuk persetujuan.                   |
| `POST /v1/purchase-orders`                            | Buat PO (dari PR disetujui).                    |
| `POST /v1/purchase-orders/{id}/approve`               | Setujui PO → `procurement.po.approved.v1`.      |
| `POST /v1/goods-receipts`                             | Catat penerimaan → `procurement.goods.received.v1`. |
| `GET /v1/purchase-orders?vendorId=…&status=Approved`  | Daftar PO.                                     |

`goods.received` memicu pencatatan AP (INT-002) & penambahan stok (Inventory).

