## 5.3 Inventory API — API-017

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/warehouses`, `/v1/stock-balances`, `/v1/stock-movements`, `/v1/stock-reservations` |
| Layanan | SVC-013 inventory-service |
| Tabel | `inv.warehouse`, `inv.stock_balance`, `inv.stock_movement`, `inv.stock_reservation` |
| Referensi | 9.8, INT-001 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                                        | Deskripsi                                      | Catatan |
| ---------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------- |
| `GET /v1/stock-balances?warehouseId=…&itemId=…`      | Saldo stok (on-hand/reserved/available).       |         |
| `POST /v1/stock-reservations`                         | Reservasi stok untuk SO (Idempotency-Key).     | **EOS** |
| `POST /v1/stock-reservations/{id}/release`            | Lepas reservasi.                               | EOS     |
| `POST /v1/stock-movements`                            | Catat pergerakan (receipt/issue/transfer/adj). |         |
| `GET /v1/stock-movements?itemId=…&movementDate[gte]=…`| Riwayat pergerakan (terpartisi).               |         |

Reservasi & pengeluaran menghasilkan `erp.inventory.stock.reserved.v1` / `erp.inventory.goods.issued.v1` (Exactly-Once) — bagian dari Saga INT-001.

