## 5.4 Sales API — API-018

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/sales-orders`, `/v1/deliveries` |
| Layanan | SVC-015 sales-service |
| Tabel | `so.sales_order`, `so.so_line`, `so.delivery` |
| Referensi | 9.14, INT-001 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                              | Deskripsi                                      |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `POST /v1/sales-orders`                     | Buat Sales Order draft.                        |
| `POST /v1/sales-orders/{id}/confirm`        | Konfirmasi → `sales.order.confirmed.v1` (mulai Saga INT-001). |
| `POST /v1/sales-orders/{id}/deliveries`     | Buat pengiriman (memicu goods issue).          |
| `GET /v1/sales-orders?customerId=…&status=Confirmed` | Daftar SO.                            |

**Skema `SalesOrder` (create):** `customerId`, `orderDate`, `currency`, `lines[] { itemId, orderQty, unitPrice }`.

